type: software
title: "DAKP: Drug Approvals Knowledge Provider"
version: 1.9.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/glusman-team/dakp
abstract: DAKP is a reproducible pipeline that turns DailyMed, Drugs@FDA, and FAERS into NCATS Translator assertion tables (approved-treats, observed-use, and contraindication), ready for Tablassert KGX modeling.
